    "commit_message": "feat(lcars-portal): consolidate KPI stat-tile dupes onto shared wb primitive (USS-TJR-MSN-0384)\n\nThree independent KpiDashboard.tsx implementations (captains-brief,\ncapture, human-systems workbenches) each hand-rolled the same\nnumber+label stat-cell pattern. Extracted to src/components/ui/KpiStat.tsx\n(KpiStat + KpiCard), all three call sites migrated.\n\nTremor rejected at pre-flight: its Card/Metric primitives theme via a\nfixed internal color palette (needs a tailwind color-key remap, not a\nstraight re-theme) and give zero net value over the app's existing\nCard \u2014 every bespoke need (click-to-jump, tone coloring, chip\nbreakdowns, badges, loading/error states) would be rebuilt inside its\nwrapper anyway. Confirmed with user before proceeding without it.\n\nLibraryKpis.tsx and CommandStatus.tsx/NowView.tsx verified and\nexcluded: former is on the legacy LCARS token system (separate\nmigration), latter two are not KPI/stat-tile patterns at all despite\ngrep matching on file name.\n\ntsc --noEmit and next build both clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GUFShZbXVTbmDDYpU8ng4q",
